    <briefdescription>
<para>Immutable config snapshot transported from message thread to GL thread via <ref refid="classjam_1_1Mailbox" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/docs/tagfile.xml">jam::Mailbox</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Built on the message thread when config changes (shader project switch, shader file edit, channel routing change). The GL thread reads it in renderOpenGL() and recompiles/reloads as needed.</para>
<para>Thread contract: constructed and written on MESSAGE THREAD only. Read and consumed on GL THREAD only. Transport is lock-free via <ref refid="classjam_1_1Mailbox" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/docs/tagfile.xml">jam::Mailbox</ref> atomic pointer exchange. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
